 "segments": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.35,
   "e": 6.057,
   "text": "To test these theorems for ourselves, we built a live diagnostic experiment in PyTorch,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.707,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 6.266,
   "e": 7.892,
   "text": "and ran it on this laptop.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 1.627,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 8.675,
   "e": 14.875,
   "text": "We pitted two competing architectures against each other on the defining capability of modern foundational models:",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.2,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 15.495,
   "e": 17.895,
   "text": "In-Context Associative Recall.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 19.402,
   "e": 23.622,
   "text": "In this benchmark, the network is presented with arbitrary key-value pairs",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.22,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 23.712,
   "e": 29.269,
   "text": "and must dynamically retrieve the correct value when queried with a corresponding key later in the sequence.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.557,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 30.542,
   "e": 34.502,
   "text": "The first contender is a Self-Organizing Dynamic Rewiring Network,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.96,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 34.708,
   "e": 41.148,
   "text": "equipped with continuous Hebbian updates, localized synaptic competition, and top-k structural edge pruning.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.44,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 41.487,
   "e": 47.133,
   "text": "The second contender is a small two-layer attention Transformer, trained with ordinary backpropagation.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.646,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 48.203,
   "e": 50.4,
   "text": "Both models saw identical data:",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.197,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 50.514,
   "e": 58.304,
   "text": "sixty-four dimensional embeddings, sixteen key-value pairs per sequence, thirteen possible values, for one hundred epochs.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 7.79,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 59.006,
   "e": 60.908,
   "text": "The results were unequivocal.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 1.902,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 61.728,
   "e": 65.533,
   "text": "For the first forty epochs, nothing seemed to happen.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.805,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 65.753,
   "e": 68.153,
   "text": "Both networks hovered just above chance,",
   "dur": 2.4,
   "voiced": 148,
   "sim": 0.662,
   "f0": 118.87,
   "st": -0.164,
   "range_st": 4.115,
   "asr": 0.769,
   "attempts": 3,
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 68.25,
   "e": 72.223,
   "text": "which for thirteen possible values is seven point seven percent.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.973,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 73.5,
   "e": 75.987,
   "text": "The self-organizing network never left that floor.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.486,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 76.37,
   "e": 79.282,
   "text": "Its recall accuracy flatlined near twelve percent,",
   "dur": 2.912,
   "voiced": 207,
   "sim": 0.712,
   "f0": 121.518,
   "st": 0.218,
   "range_st": 6.401,
   "asr": 0.8,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 79.591,
   "e": 83.253,
   "text": "completely unable to bind dynamic keys to their values in context.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.662,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "s": 84.584,
   "e": 88.046,
   "text": "Its local updates kept compressing its representation anyway.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.461,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "s": 88.537,
   "e": 92.375,
   "text": "Its effective rank drifted down from forty-nine toward thirty,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.837,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "s": 92.5,
   "e": 94.353,
   "text": "without ever learning the task.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 1.852,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "s": 95.208,
   "e": 97.138,
   "text": "And the gradient paths explain why.",
   "dur": 1.93,
   "voiced": 140,
   "sim": 0.726,
   "f0": 123.642,
   "st": 0.518,
   "range_st": 8.042,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 10,
   "level": 3
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "s": 98.152,
   "e": 100.316,
   "text": "Structural mutations are discrete.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.164,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "s": 100.718,
   "e": 104.499,
   "text": "A pruning mask is a step function, with no useful derivative.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.781,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "s": 104.719,
   "e": 109.639,
   "text": "The optimization could not send credit across the links it was busy creating and destroying,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "s": 109.777,
   "e": 112.324,
   "text": "locking the architecture into poor local minima.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.547,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "s": 113.024,
   "e": 116.059,
   "text": "The Transformer, meanwhile, did something remarkable.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.035,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "s": 116.622,
   "e": 119.922,
   "text": "Around epoch forty-five, its accuracy suddenly jumped,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.301,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "s": 120.075,
   "e": 124.004,
   "text": "from under thirty percent to ninety-nine percent in just four epochs,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.929,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "s": 124.243,
   "e": 126.453,
   "text": "and then settled at one hundred.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.21,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "s": 127.244,
   "e": 134.913,
   "text": "That sudden leap looks exactly like the phase change Olsson and colleagues tied to the formation of induction heads.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 7.668,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "s": 136.06,
   "e": 138.669,
   "text": "The theory survived contact with real silicon.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.609,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "s": 138.889,
   "e": 145.079,
   "text": "Without all-to-all bilinear attention, local rewiring algorithms cannot sustain dynamic in-context memory.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.189,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "s": 145.802,
   "e": 149.747,
   "text": "The Transformer's dense matrix multiplications win decisively.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.945,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  }
 ]
